Several bug reports have been closed on this issue with no resolution. Seems to have been ongoing for more than a year.

I am using gpt-4o, with the following crew.py:

```python
from crewai import Agent, Crew, Process, Task, LLM
from crewai.project import CrewBase, agent, crew, task


@CrewBase
class SecureCodeCrew:
    """SecureCodingCrew crew"""

    agents_config = "config/agents.yaml"
    tasks_config = "config/tasks.yaml"

